# Bifur doubles the triggered abilities of Dwarves "you control" only (CR 603.2d): Bot1 has Bifur and an enduring story, and
# on turn two Bot2's Fíli enters - its enters ability triggers once, and Bot2 gets one Dwarf token. The positive control is
# bifur-melodic-rider-doubles-filis-enters-ability-for-two-dwarves.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Bifur, Melodic Rider
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Fíli the Pathfinder
Island
Island
Island x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Bifur, Melodic Rider.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
? Bot1.EnduringStory = true
Bot2.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Fíli the Pathfinder.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
[T2 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield = Plains; Mox Pearl; Mox Jet; Mox Ruby; Fíli the Pathfinder; Dwarf Token
